DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
7362::$$$message_0051_0000_0000$$$::[cacheimage storage=氷室私服02a(中)]::
7363::$$$message_0051_0000_0001$$$::[dash mx=0 opacity=80 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=411 imag=2 time=2000 cy=9 mag=2 my=100 storage=o山門階段(アップ)(秋)-(曇2) rot=-0.0 accel=-2 textoff=0]The long, long stairway to Ryudou Temple terminates at the mountain gate.[wdash canskip=0][lr]::
7364::$$$message_0051_0000_0002$$$::[dash mx=0 opacity=55 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=400 imag=1.203 time=1600 cy=42 mag=1 my=258 storage=o山門階段(遠景)(秋)-(曇2) rot=-0.0 accel=-2 textoff=0]Its gatekeeper[line len=2]Sasaki Kojirou, the swordsman assassin of a different time[line len=2]is nowhere to be seen.[wdash canskip=0][lr]::
7365::$$$message_0051_0000_0003$$$::Instead... [wait canskip=0 time=600][chgfg time=200 storage=氷室私服02a(中) textoff=0]Cool eyes appreciate the gate. They belong to the person everyone calls the lady scholar.::
7366::$$$message_0051_0001_0000$$$::"...So he really isn't here at this time of day."[lr]::
7367::$$$message_0051_0001_0001$$$::[cacheimage storage=氷室私服01a(中)]::
7368::$$$message_0051_0001_0002$$$::"Are you talking about Issei, Himuro?"[lr]::
7369::$$$message_0051_0001_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服01a(中) textoff=0]I can't imagine what business she would have with Issei, though. Himuro isn't on the student council.::
7370::$$$message_0051_0002_0000$$$::"Ah, Emiya. If I recall, you're close with the temple boy."[lr]::
7371::$$$message_0051_0002_0001$$$::"More like I can't get rid of him... Did you have some business at the temple?"[lr]::
7372::$$$message_0051_0002_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服02d(中) textoff=0]I feel like she was looking at the gate itself.[lr]::
7373::$$$message_0051_0002_0003$$$::I wonder if she's going to suddenly discern that the pair of Aun guardian statues were carved by a famous Buddhist sculptor in the Kamakura-era...::
7374::$$$message_0051_0003_0000$$$::"Yukika said she saw him."[lr]::
7375::$$$message_0051_0003_0001$$$::"Saw who?"[lr]::
7376::$$$message_0051_0003_0002$$$::"When she said he looked like a samurai...Makidera was terrified that he might be a ghost, but I have my suspicions."[lr]::
7377::$$$message_0051_0003_0003$$$::[fadein noclear=1 time=400 rule=波 storage=a13 textoff=0]...She's talking about Kojirou.[lr]::
7378::$$$message_0051_0003_0004$$$::[fadein noclear=1 time=400 rule=波 storage=o山門階段(アップ)(秋)-(曇2) textoff=0]Though I obviously can't tell her the truth, it isn't exactly wrong to call him a ghost.[lr]::
7379::$$$message_0051_0003_0005$$$::But how can Saegusa see him...?::
7380::$$$message_0051_0004_0000$$$::"Still, a ghost at the temple? I doubt he inhabits the gate itself. If he did, it would demonstrate that the temple lacks virtue."[lr]::
7381::$$$message_0051_0004_0001$$$::"Maybe this temple just doesn't specialize in driving malignant spirits away."[lr]::
7382::$$$message_0051_0004_0002$$$::"Regardless of their sect, if a monk of sufficient virtue is present, then no vengeful or mischievous ghost would dare approach."[lr]::
7383::$$$message_0051_0004_0003$$$::"Maybe you can only see ghosts at night."::
7384::$$$message_0051_0005_0000$$$::"Quite the opposite, I think. It's possible to mistake other things for ghosts in the darkness.[lr]::
7385::$$$message_0051_0005_0001$$$::But in broad daylight, you would easily catch such a mistake... [cacheimage storage=氷室私服02a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=氷室私服02a(中) time=300 textoff=0]And perhaps, discover that there's a far more mundane explanation."[lr]::
7386::$$$message_0051_0005_0002$$$::I nod. That makes sense. Very rational.[lr]::
7387::$$$message_0051_0005_0003$$$::[dash mx=-472 opacity=100 layer=base irot=-0.079 cx=669 imag=3 time=3000 cy=124 mag=3 my=-72 storage=o山門階段(アップ)(秋)-(曇2) rot=0.01 accel=-2]I hate to break it to you, Himuro, but he really does exist.[lr]::
7388::$$$message_0051_0005_0004$$$::Himuro scans the gate again.[wdash canskip=0]::
7389::$$$message_0051_0006_0000$$$::"And yet, there's nothing to mistake for a ghost here. [cacheimage storage=氷室私服01a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=氷室私服01a(中) time=300 textoff=0]What an enigma."[lr]::
7390::$$$message_0051_0006_0001$$$::Clearly, [chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服02d(中) textoff=0]Himuro's at a loss. She's pondering how to reconcile the eyewitness account with her observations.::
7391::$$$message_0051_0007_0000$$$::"Maybe he really exists. There could be a legend about a deserter or a fallen soldier here at the temple."[lr]::
7392::$$$message_0051_0007_0001$$$::"Are you the type to believe in such beings, Emiya?"[lr]::
7393::$$$message_0051_0007_0002$$$::"I can't exactly prove they [font italic=true]don't[font italic=false] exist at all."[lr]::
7394::$$$message_0051_0007_0003$$$::I bet Illya or Tohsaka could come up with plenty of counterpoints.[lr]::
7395::$$$message_0051_0007_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服01a(中) textoff=0]Himuro gives off an intellectual air that paints a sharp contrast between herself and those who consider themselves versed in magecraft, however.::
7396::$$$message_0051_0008_0000$$$::"So you don't believe he exists. Are you an atheist? A materialist?"[lr]::
7397::$$$message_0051_0008_0001$$$::"That's quite uncharitable of you. I simply want to find a reason for him to exist... [l][say storage=ryu0311_him_0091 name=氷室][chgfg storage=氷室私服02d(中) time=300 textoff=0]Regardless of whether the gods or Buddha desires it."::
7398::$$$message_0051_0009_0000$$$::I consider her words.[lr]::
7399::$$$message_0051_0009_0001$$$::I nod along, as if listening to a chemistry or physics teacher's lecture.[lr]::
7400::$$$message_0051_0009_0002$$$::She probably doesn't get approached by guys much, considering how she talks.[lr]::
7401::$$$message_0051_0009_0003$$$::Though I'm pretty interested in what she has to say.::
7402::$$$message_0051_0010_0000$$$::"Supposing he does exist, it might be possible to deduce his identity from local histories or temple records."[lr]::
7403::$$$message_0051_0010_0001$$$::"You think a corresponding historical figure would be his identity?"[lr]::
7404::$$$message_0051_0010_0002$$$::"It would make me feel slightly better, at least."[lr]::
7405::$$$message_0051_0010_0003$$$::I see. She's uncomfortable because she can't explain this phenomenon.::
7406::$$$message_0051_0011_0000$$$::"In the end, I still don't have the answer to Yukika's curiosity. I'm ashamed to admit it."[lr]::
7407::$$$message_0051_0011_0001$$$::If Saegusa saw a ghost... I doubt she'd just calmly accept it.[lr]::
7408::$$$message_0051_0011_0002$$$::I can see Makidera making a fuss about it, but what about Himuro?::
7409::$$$message_0051_0012_0000$$$::"What if you really find the ghost?"[lr]::
7410::$$$message_0051_0012_0001$$$::"...I haven't thought that far ahead."[lr]::
7411::$$$message_0051_0012_0002$$$::...Is it unreasonable to ask her to imagine a situation where she encounters something she isn't sure exists?[lr]::
7412::$$$message_0051_0012_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服02b(中) textoff=0]Himuro seems to consider the question.::
7413::$$$message_0051_0013_0000$$$::"I suppose there's no use dwelling on a question I can't answer.[lr]::
7414::$$$message_0051_0013_0001$$$::I'll just have to consult a specialist."[lr]::
7415::$$$message_0051_0013_0002$$$::"Like Tohsaka?"[lr]::
7416::$$$message_0051_0013_0003$$$::"What are you talking about? They're right here[line len=2]someone who we can ask about ghosts right under their noses."::
7417::$$$message_0051_0014_0000$$$::Oh, that's where she's going with this.[lr]::
7418::$$$message_0051_0014_0001$$$::Didn't Issei say that there isn't anyone with actual dharmic power in the Ryudou clan? [l]On the other hand, I remember hearing there used to be people like that in the Tohsaka line.::
7419::$$$message_0051_0015_0000$$$::"I'm going to take a look around the temple grounds. I'll ask the temple boy to catch the ghost if I see him."[lr]::
7420::$$$message_0051_0015_0001$$$::"I don't think Issei knows anything about ghosts."::
7421::$$$message_0051_0016_0000$$$::"The solution could be right under our noses, you know. It might not be a bad idea to pray to the mountain for aid while I'm here."[lr]::
7422::$$$message_0051_0016_0001$$$::"What, for good grades?"[lr]::
7423::$$$message_0051_0016_0002$$$::That sounds like something Himuro would do.[lr]::
7424::$$$message_0051_0016_0003$$$::But then, she turns to me.::
7425::$$$message_0051_0017_0000$$$::"...For a relationship."[lr]::
7426::$$$message_0051_0017_0001$$$::"Eh?"[lr]::
7427::$$$message_0051_0017_0002$$$::She utters something I never imagined I'd hear from her.[lr]::
7428::$$$message_0051_0017_0003$$$::Himuro wants a relationship? With whom?::
7429::$$$message_0051_0018_0000$$$::"You look surprised again, Emiya.[lr]::
7430::$$$message_0051_0018_0001$$$::[chgfg storage=氷室私服01b(中) time=300 textoff=0]Does the thought of me meeting a good partner offend you?"[lr]::
7431::$$$message_0051_0018_0002$$$::"No, but..."::
7432::$$$message_0051_0019_0000$$$::"Back at the park, you looked like you wanted to make a remark when I mentioned romance. Do you have something to say?"[lr]::
7433::$$$message_0051_0019_0001$$$::I was just surprised. It was a bolt out of the blue.[lr]::
7434::$$$message_0051_0019_0002$$$::That's also true this time, though.::
7435::$$$message_0051_0020_0000$$$::"...I hope you don't get the wrong idea. Just because I'm asking doesn't mean I'm interested in you."[lr]::
7436::$$$message_0051_0020_0001$$$::"It's all right. We're just chatting without any undertones, I get it."::
7437::$$$message_0051_0021_0000$$$::"Very good.[lr]::
7438::$$$message_0051_0021_0001$$$::Still, ghosts and romance aren't so different. Such nuanced topics fascinate me.[lr]::
7439::$$$message_0051_0021_0002$$$::They're so picturesque."[lr]::
7440::$$$message_0051_0021_0003$$$::"Huh?"::
7441::$$$message_0051_0022_0000$$$::"Don't inquire any further.[lr]::
7442::$$$message_0051_0022_0001$$$::Even if I prayed for romance, it would be for the future of the lovers I'll observe... To be clear, I've never given any thought to my own romance. [cacheimage storage=氷室私服01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服01a(中) textoff=0]Though I can throw in a prayer for your benefit, while I'm at it."[lr]::
7443::$$$message_0051_0022_0002$$$::[clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から pos=all time=300]With that parting remark, Himuro leaves briskly through the temple gate.::
7444::$$$message_0051_0023_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
7445::$$$message_0051_0023_0001$$$::I gotta say...[lr]::
7446::$$$message_0051_0023_0002$$$::Our school sure has a lot of odd characters.::
907366::$$$message_9051_0001_0000$$$::"...So he really isn't here at this time of day."[r]:Z�o